  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "M\u1ECDi vi\u1EC7c \u0111\u1EC1u di\u1EC5n ra \u0111\xFAng theo k\u1EBF
    ho\u1EA1ch ho\u1EB7c s\u1EF1 mong \u0111\u1EE3i. Th\xE0nh c\xF4ng v\xE0 danh
    ti\u1EBFng l\u1EABn v\u1EADn may \u0111\u1EC1u bi\u1EBFn th\xE0nh hi\u1EC7n th\u1EF1c.
    Tuy nhi\xEAn, s\u1EF1 qu\xE1 t\u1EF1 m\xE3n, s\u1EF1 qu\xE1 th\u1ECFa m\xE3n
    v\xE0 ki\xEAu ng\u1EA1o hay th\xE1i \u0111\u1ED9 h\u1ED1ng h\xE1ch s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0a
    \u0111\u1EBFn nh\u1EEFng \u0111i\u1EC1u kh\xF4ng may. Do \u0111\xF3, c\u1EA7n
    ph\u1EA3i c\u1EA9n tr\u1ECDng, chu \u0111\xE1o v\xE0 suy ngh\u0129 khi l\xE0m
    m\u1ECDi vi\u1EC7c."
